at require you to step on them or an attached pressure plate.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Rage of Elements","authors":""},"rules":[],"traits":{"value":[],"otherTags":[]},"slug":"levitator","_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.365","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.4.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.familiar-abilities.Item.q9IXWngAOCpsXxsO","createdTime":1786661281179,"modifiedTime":1786661281179,"lastModifiedBy":"mU2CbRb109YQ64CK","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{},"_id":"XXQMlyr7TDoU0n0Z","ownership":{"default":0}},{"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Elemental (Metal)","system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"familiar","description":{"value":"<p>Your familiar has the elemental trait instead of the animal trait. Choose air, earth, fire, metal, water, or wood. Your familiar gains that trait. The familiar is immune to bleed, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.6uEgoh53GbXuHpTF]{Paralyzed}, poison, sleep, and the element matching its trait. Your familiar must have the resistance familiar ability to select this.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Rage of Elements","authors":""},"rules":[{"choices":[{"label":"PF2E.TraitAir","value":"air"},{"label":"PF2E.TraitEarth","value":"earth"},{"label":"PF2E.TraitFire","value":"fire"},{"label":"PF2E.TraitMetal","value":"metal"},{"label":"PF2E.TraitWater","value":"water"},{"label":"PF2E.TraitWood","value":"wood"}],"flag":"element","key":"ChoiceSet","prompt":"PF2E.SpecificRule.Prompt.Element","selection":"metal"},{"add":["elemental","{item|flags.system.rulesSelections.element}"],"key":"ActorTraits","remove":["animal"]},{"key":"Immunity","type":["bleed","paralyzed","poison","sleep","{item|flags.system.rulesSelections.element}"]}],"traits":{"value":[],"